OK entry claim calls digits and constrains its result to oddDigitProduct(N,0)
ENTRY_WITNESS N=1 precondition=True candidate=1 canonical=1 summary=1
ENTRY_WITNESS N=4 precondition=True candidate=0 canonical=0 summary=0
ENTRY_WITNESS N=235 precondition=True candidate=15 canonical=15 summary=15
ENTRY_WITNESS N=10203 precondition=True candidate=3 canonical=3 summary=3
